{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "id": "act:islandfixture-author",
  "name": "Island Author",
  "components": [],
  "variables": [],
  "events": [
    {
      "event": "BeginPlay",
      "body": {
        "id": "begin",
        "name": "begin",
        "params": [],
        "ret": "Unit",
        "body": [
          {
            "ExprStmt": {
              "Call": {
                "path": [
                  "item",
                  "define"
                ],
                "args": [
                  {
                    "Lit": {
                      "Str": "# **THE WEAPON REGISTRY** (wave WPN2a) -- 85 rows, read by\n# `inf_ecs::weapon::WEAPON_REGISTRY_TOML` through `include_str!`.\n#\n# The rows are the user's research doc's own tables\n# (`docs/Weapons-in-Rust-based-Game-Engine-GTA-Game.md`, sections 1-7 of the\n# dataset): 10 pistols, 20 SMGs, 20 assault rifles, 10 DMRs, 10 snipers,\n# 10 shotguns and 5 launchers. Its eight metrics reach this engine's doors as\n# follows, and every derived number is derived by ONE rule per class so any row\n# can be checked by hand:\n#\n#   class         -> `class`, the string key wave WPN2c added beside `kind`.\n#                    It is the one metric the doc's tables carry that is not a\n#                    number: seven tables, seven classes, and a report's five\n#                    clips are chosen by it (`inf_ecs::weapon::WeaponClass`).\n#   torso damage  -> `damage_j`, at 20 J per hit point\n#                    (`inf_ecs::weapon::JOULES_PER_HIT_POINT`: DEFAULT_VITALITY_J\n#                    2000 J is a 100 HP body, so the scale is forced, not chosen\n#                    -- and it reproduces island wave I6's own 600 J pistol).\n#   head damage   -> `damage_curve.headshot_mult` = head / torso.\n#   RPM           -> `rounds_per_minute`.\n#   velocity      -> `muzzle_speed_mps`.\n#   effective rng -> `damage_curve.effective_range_m`; `max_range_m` and\n#                    `min_damage_frac` are the class rule below (the doc gives\n#                    the pair only for its M4A1 example: 35 -> 80 m, 18 of 30,\n#                    which is x2.3 and 0.6, and that is the AR row here).\n#   recoil 1-10   -> `recoil.recoil_intensity`. WAVE WPN2b reads it; nothing does\n#                    today, and it is authored now so the rows are written once.\n#   ADS ms        -> `ads_time_ms`. Wave WPN2b, same sentence.\n#   mag           -> `magazine`; `reserve` is four magazines (three for a\n#                    launcher), which is a carry rule and not the doc's.\n#   move speed    -> `move_speed_mult`, and this one has a consumer HERE:\n#                    `inf_ecs::movement::settings_for` scales the target speed by\n#                    it, so a sniper really is slower than a bare pair of hands.\n#\n# PER-CLASS RULES (threshold / range / drag / max-range factor / min fraction /\n# spread / muzzle / reload / mass / report):\n#\n#   pistol    30 m  150 m  0.0008 /m  x2.5  0.50  1.20 deg  0.12 m  1.4 s  0.9 kg  220 m\n#   smg       15 m  180 m  0.0007 /m  x2.5  0.50  1.60 deg  0.25 m  1.8 s  3.0 kg  240 m\n#   ar        25 m  500 m  0.00035/m  x2.3  0.60  1.00 deg  0.45 m  2.0 s  3.6 kg  320 m\n#   dmr       15 m  800 m  0.0003 /m  x2.0  0.70  0.40 deg  0.55 m  2.4 s  4.4 kg  420 m\n#   sniper    10 m 1800 m  0.00022/m  x2.0  0.80  0.15 deg  0.65 m  3.0 s  6.5 kg  600 m\n#   shotgun   10 m   80 m  0.0015 /m  x2.0  0.35  3.00 deg  0.50 m  3.2 s  3.4 kg  260 m\n#   launcher   0 m  900 m  0.0006 /m  flat  1.00  0.50 deg  0.70 m  doc    7.0 kg  900 m\n#\n# The hitscan thresholds are the doc's own class table: \"Pistols: pure hitscan\n# (<30 m)\", \"SMGs: short hitscan threshold (15 m)\", \"Assault rifles: hybrid\n# (25 m raycast, then 700-900 m/s projectile)\", \"Snipers: pure projectile or\n# minimal hitscan (<10 m)\", \"Rocket launchers: physical entity projectile\" --\n# which is a threshold of zero, so a rocket is a body from the muzzle. A pistol\n# whose 30 m threshold covers its own effective envelope is the doc's \"pure\n# hitscan\" expressed as a CONSEQUENCE rather than as a second `ShotKind`; past\n# it, at 40 m, a 9 mm round really does fly and really does drop.\n#\n# WHAT IS NOT MODELLED YET, said in the file rather than only in a report:\n#\n# * SHOTGUN PELLETS. `damage_j` here is the WHOLE PULL -- pellets x per-pellet\n#   torso x 20 J -- delivered as one hit, because wave WPN2a has one ray per\n#   trigger pull. WAVE WPN2d splits it: N rays off `shot_uniforms` inside\n#   `cone_deg`, each carrying its own share, drawing on\n#   `MAX_SHOT_RAYS_PER_STEP`. The per-pellet numbers are in the doc's table 6\n#   and in the comment above each row.\n# * LAUNCHER BLAST. `damage_j` is the doc's DIRECT impact damage only. The blast\n#   radius, the falloff sweep and lock-on are wave WPN2d's; a rocket here flies,\n#   drops and spends its direct damage on what it hits.\n# * BURST FIRE. The engine has `automatic` and semi and no burst, so the doc's\n#   three-round-burst rows (FAMAS F1, Type 95, CZ 75 Auto, TEC-9) are authored\n#   AUTOMATIC at their listed RPM. A burst mode is wave WPN2b's fire-control\n#   work; naming it here is cheaper than a reader wondering.\n# * ATTACHMENTS. The doc's ~600 attachment rows are wave WPN2d's; nothing here\n#   carries a slot.\n#\n# REAL NAMES: nominative use. See `WEAPON_REGISTRY_TOML`'s own doc comment for\n# the recorded decision.\n#\n# GENERATED, and byte-pinned: `wpn2a_gate::the_registry_is_the_docs_own_tables`\n# counts the rows per class and re-derives every damage figure from the doc's HP.\n# Edit the numbers here, not a copy of them.\n\n# --------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# 1. HANDGUNS / PISTOLS (10)\n# --------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n[glock_17]\nlabel = \"Glock 17\"\nstack_max = 1\nmass_kg = 0.90\n[glock_17.weapon]\nkind = \"projectile\"\nclass = \"pistol\"\nautomatic = false\ndamage_j = 600.0\nrounds_per_minute = 450.0\nspread_deg = 1.20\nmagazine = 17\nreserve = 68\nreload_s = 1.40\nrange_m = 150.0\nmuzzle_speed_mps = 375.0\nmuzzle_forward_m = 0.12\nads_time_ms = 140.0\nmove_speed_mult = 0.98\n[glock_17.weapon.ballistics]\nhitscan_threshold_m = 30.0\ndrag_k = 0.00080\ngravity_scale = 1.0\n[glock_17.weapon.damage_curve]\nheadshot_mult = 1.6000\neffective_range_m = 18.0\nmax_range_m = 45.0\nmin_damage_frac = 0.50\n[glock_17.weapon.recoil]\nrecoil_intensity = 2.5\n[glock_17.weapon.audio]\nreport_max_m = 220.0\n\n[sig_p320]\nlabel = \"SIG Sauer P320\"\nstack_max = 1\nmass_kg = 0.90\n[sig_p320.weapon]\nkind = \"projectile\"\nclass = \"pistol\"\nautomatic = false\ndamage_j = 640.0\nrounds_per_minute = 430.0\nspread_deg = 1.20\nmagazine = 17\nreserve = 68\nreload_s = 1.40\nrange_m = 150.0\nmuzzle_speed_mps = 380.0\nmuzzle_forward_m = 0.12\nads_time_ms = 145.0\nmove_speed_mult = 0.98\n[sig_p320.weapon.ballistics]\nhitscan_threshold_m = 30.0\ndrag_k = 0.00080\ngravity_scale = 1.0\n[sig_p320.weapon.damage_curve]\nheadshot_mult = 1.5625\neffective_range_m = 20.0\nmax_range_m = 50.0\nmin_damage_frac = 0.50\n[sig_p320.weapon.recoil]\nrecoil_intensity = 2.8\n[sig_p320.weapon.audio]\nreport_max_m = 220.0\n\n[beretta_92fs]\nlabel = \"Beretta 92FS\"\nstack_max = 1\nmass_kg = 0.90\n[beretta_92fs.weapon]\nkind = \"projectile\"\nclass = \"pistol\"\nautomatic = false\ndamage_j = 560.0\nrounds_per_minute = 480.0\nspread_deg = 1.20\nmagazine = 15\nreserve = 60\nreload_s = 1.40\nrange_m = 150.0\nmuzzle_speed_mps = 381.0\nmuzzle_forward_m = 0.12\nads_time_ms = 135.0\nmove_speed_mult = 0.98\n[beretta_92fs.weapon.ballistics]\nhitscan_threshold_m = 30.0\ndrag_k = 0.00080\ngravity_scale = 1.0\n[beretta_92fs.weapon.damage_curve]\nheadshot_mult = 1.6071\neffective_range_m = 18.0\nmax_range_m = 45.0\nmin_damage_frac = 0.50\n[beretta_92fs.weapon.recoil]\nrecoil_intensity = 2.2\n[beretta_92fs.weapon.audio]\nreport_max_m = 220.0\n\n[colt_m1911]\nlabel = \"Colt M1911\"\nstack_max = 1\nmass_kg = 0.90\n[colt_m1911.weapon]\nkind = \"projectile\"\nclass = \"pistol\"\nautomatic = false\ndamage_j = 840.0\nrounds_per_minute = 350.0\nspread_deg = 1.20\nmagazine = 7\nreserve = 28\nreload_s = 1.40\nrange_m = 150.0\nmuzzle_speed_mps = 253.0\nmuzzle_forward_m = 0.12\nads_time_ms = 160.0\nmove_speed_mult = 0.97\n[colt_m1911.weapon.ballistics]\nhitscan_threshold_m = 30.0\ndrag_k = 0.00080\ngravity_scale = 1.0\n[colt_m1911.weapon.damage_curve]\nheadshot_mult = 1.5476\neffective_range_m = 15.0\nmax_range_m = 37.5\nmin_damage_frac = 0.50\n[colt_m1911.weapon.recoil]\nrecoil_intensity = 4.2\n[colt_m1911.weapon.audio]\nreport_max_m = 220.0\n\n[fn_five_seven]\nlabel = \"FN Five-seveN\"\nstack_max = 1\nmass_kg = 0.90\n[fn_five_seven.weapon]\nkind = \"projectile\"\nclass = \"pistol\"\nautomatic = false\ndamage_j = 480.0\nrounds_per_minute = 520.0\nspread_deg = 1.20\nmagazine = 20\nreserve = 80\nreload_s = 1.40\nrange_m = 150.0\nmuzzle_speed_mps = 650.0\nmuzzle_forward_m = 0.12\nads_time_ms = 130.0\nmove_speed_mult = 0.99\n[fn_five_seven.weapon.ballistics]\nhitscan_threshold_m = 30.0\ndrag_k = 0.00080\ngravity_scale = 1.0\n[fn_five_seven.weapon.damage_curve]\nheadshot_mult = 1.6667\neffective_range_m = 30.0\nmax_range_m = 75.0\nmin_damage_frac = 0.50\n[fn_five_seven.weapon.recoil]\nrecoil_intensity = 1.8\n[fn_five_seven.weapon.audio]\nreport_max_m = 220.0\n\n[desert_eagle]\nlabel = \"Desert Eagle\"\nstack_max = 1\nmass_kg = 0.90\n[desert_eagle.weapon]\nkind = \"projectile\"\nclass = \"pistol\"\nautomatic = false\ndamage_j = 1440.0\nrounds_per_minute = 180.0\nspread_deg = 1.20\nmagazine = 7\nreserve = 28\nreload_s = 1.40\nrange_m = 150.0\nmuzzle_speed_mps = 470.0\nmuzzle_forward_m = 0.12\nads_time_ms = 220.0\nmove_speed_mult = 0.94\n[desert_eagle.weapon.ballistics]\nhitscan_threshold_m = 30.0\ndrag_k = 0.00080\ngravity_scale = 1.0\n[desert_eagle.weapon.damage_curve]\nheadshot_mult = 1.6667\neffective_range_m = 25.0\nmax_range_m = 62.5\nmin_damage_frac = 0.50\n[desert_eagle.weapon.recoil]\nrecoil_intensity = 8.5\n[desert_eagle.weapon.audio]\nreport_max_m = 220.0\n\n[sw_model_500]\nlabel = \"S&W Model 500\"\nstack_max = 1\nmass_kg = 0.90\n[sw_model_500.weapon]\nkind = \"projectile\"\nclass = \"pistol\"\nautomatic = false\ndamage_j = 1800.0\nrounds_per_minute = 110.0\nspread_deg = 1.20\nmagazine = 5\nreserve = 20\nreload_s = 1.40\nrange_m = 150.0\nmuzzle_speed_mps = 630.0\nmuzzle_forward_m = 0.12\nads_time_ms = 260.0\nmove_speed_mult = 0.92\n[sw_model_500.weapon.ballistics]\nhitscan_threshold_m = 30.0\ndrag_k = 0.00080\ngravity_scale = 1.0\n[sw_model_500.weapon.damage_curve]\nheadshot_mult = 1.6667\neffective_range_m = 35.0\nmax_range_m = 87.5\nmin_damage_frac = 0.50\n[sw_model_500.weapon.recoil]\nrecoil_intensity = 9.8\n[sw_model_500.weapon.audio]\nreport_max_m = 220.0\n\n[cz_75_auto]\nlabel = \"CZ 75 Auto\"\nstack_max = 1\nmass_kg = 0.90\n[cz_75_auto.weapon]\nkind = \"projectile\"\nclass = \"pistol\"\nautomatic = true\ndamage_j = 440.0\nrounds_per_minute = 900.0\nspread_deg = 1.20\nmagazine = 26\nreserve = 104\nreload_s = 1.40\nrange_m = 150.0\nmuzzle_speed_mps = 360.0\nmuzzle_forward_m = 0.12\nads_time_ms = 150.0\nmove_speed_mult = 0.96\n[cz_75_auto.weapon.ballistics]\nhitscan_threshold_m = 30.0\ndrag_k = 0.00080\ngravity_scale = 1.0\n[cz_75_auto.weapon.damage_curve]\nheadshot_mult = 1.5909\neffective_range_m = 12.0\nmax_range_m = 30.0\nmin_damage_frac = 0.50\n[cz_75_auto.weapon.recoil]\nrecoil_intensity = 5.5\n[cz_75_auto.weapon.audio]\nreport_max_m = 220.0\n\n[walther_ppk]\nlabel = \"Walther PPK\"\nstack_max = 1\nmass_kg = 0.90\n[walther_ppk.weapon]\nkind = \"projectile\"\nclass = \"pistol\"\nautomatic = false\ndamage_j = 500.0\nrounds_per_minute = 400.0\nspread_deg = 1.20\nmagazine = 8\nreserve = 32\nreload_s = 1.40\nrange_m = 150.0\nmuzzle_speed_mps = 312.0\nmuzzle_forward_m = 0.12\nads_time_ms = 110.0\nmove_speed_mult = 1.00\n[walther_ppk.weapon.ballistics]\nhitscan_threshold_m = 30.0\ndrag_k = 0.00080\ngravity_scale = 1.0\n[walther_ppk.weapon.damage_curve]\nheadshot_mult = 1.5200\neffective_range_m = 12.0\nmax_range_m = 30.0\nmin_damage_frac = 0.50\n[walther_ppk.weapon.recoil]\nrecoil_intensity = 1.9\n[walther_ppk.weapon.audio]\nreport_max_m = 220.0\n\n# The doc's Judge is a 5-pellet .410 shell (18x5 / 25x5); the whole pull is\n# one hit here and wave WPN2d splits it into pellets.\n[taurus_judge]\nlabel = \"Taurus Judge\"\nstack_max = 1\nmass_kg = 0.90\n[taurus_judge.weapon]\nkind = \"projectile\"\nclass = \"pistol\"\nautomatic = false\ndamage_j = 1800.0\nrounds_per_minute = 150.0\nspread_deg = 1.20\nmagazine = 5\nreserve = 20\nreload_s = 1.40\nrange_m = 150.0\nmuzzle_speed_mps = 270.0\nmuzzle_forward_m = 0.12\nads_time_ms = 180.0\nmove_speed_mult = 0.95\n[taurus_judge.weapon.ballistics]\nhitscan_threshold_m = 30.0\ndrag_k = 0.00080\ngravity_scale = 1.0\n[taurus_judge.weapon.damage_curve]\nheadshot_mult = 1.3889\neffective_range_m = 8.0\nmax_range_m = 20.0\nmin_damage_frac = 0.50\n[taurus_judge.weapon.recoil]\nrecoil_intensity = 7.0\n[taurus_judge.weapon.audio]\nreport_max_m = 220.0\n\n# --------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# 2. SUBMACHINE GUNS (20)\n# --------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n[mp5]\nlabel = \"MP5\"\nstack_max = 1\nmass_kg = 3.00\n[mp5.weapon]\nkind = \"projectile\"\nclass = \"smg\"\nautomatic = true\ndamage_j = 560.0\nrounds_per_minute = 800.0\nspread_deg = 1.60\nmagazine = 30\nreserve = 120\nreload_s = 1.80\nrange_m = 180.0\nmuzzle_speed_mps = 400.0\nmuzzle_forward_m = 0.25\nads_time_ms = 180.0\nmove_speed_mult = 0.95\n[mp5.weapon.ballistics]\nhitscan_threshold_m = 15.0\ndrag_k = 0.00070\ngravity_scale = 1.0\n[mp5.weapon.damage_curve]\nheadshot_mult = 1.5000\neffective_range_m = 16.0\nmax_range_m = 40.0\nmin_damage_frac = 0.50\n[mp5.weapon.recoil]\nrecoil_intensity = 3.2\n[mp5.weapon.audio]\nreport_max_m = 240.0\n\n[mp7]\nlabel = \"MP7\"\nstack_max = 1\nmass_kg = 3.00\n[mp7.weapon]\nkind = \"projectile\"\nclass = \"smg\"\nautomatic = true\ndamage_j = 440.0\nrounds_per_minute = 950.0\nspread_deg = 1.60\nmagazine = 40\nreserve = 160\nreload_s = 1.80\nrange_m = 180.0\nmuzzle_speed_mps = 735.0\nmuzzle_forward_m = 0.25\nads_time_ms = 160.0\nmove_speed_mult = 0.96\n[mp7.weapon.ballistics]\nhitscan_threshold_m = 15.0\ndrag_k = 0.00070\ngravity_scale = 1.0\n[mp7.weapon.damage_curve]\nheadshot_mult = 1.5000\neffective_range_m = 22.0\nmax_range_m = 55.0\nmin_damage_frac = 0.50\n[mp7.weapon.recoil]\nrecoil_intensity = 2.4\n[mp7.weapon.audio]\nreport_max_m = 240.